  "description": "Ever since he was a cub, Ryan has dreamed of adventuring across the world. But now that his parents--the King and Queen of Doong Doong Island--are missing, it falls on Ryan to rule the island as their heir...which means he can never leave. Rule or escape, which will Ryan choose?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66090732), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B7%B8%EB%9E%98%EB%8F%84-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EC%96%B8/4431)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[English](https://tapas.io/series/ryan-begins/info), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/174222)",
